      "content": "but it's not about growth. it's about the weight. everyone looks at me and i just see them seeing the disappointment. it's like i'm a debt that can never be paid back. i look at my parents and i just feel this overwhelming urge to make things right for them, like to just... stop being the thing that weighs them down.",
